        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Crystallize Flesh"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(primal, transmutation)\n\nTrigger: The crystal dragon damages a creature made of flesh with a jaws Strike\n\nFrequency: 1/day\n\nThe dragon embeds transformative crystals in the creature's flesh. The creature must attempt a 30 Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target is slowed 1 for 1 round as portions of its flesh turn crystalline.\n- **Failure:** The target is slowed 1 and must attempt a Fortitude save at the end of each of its turns; this ongoing save has the incapacitation trait. On a failed save, the slowed condition value increases by 1 (or by 2 on a critical failure). A successful save reduces the slowed condition value by 1. A creature unable to act due to the slowed condition from Crystallize Flesh is petrified permanently, transforming into a crystalline statue. The effect ends if the creature is petrified or the slowed condition is removed.\n- **Critical Failure:** As failure, but the target is initially slowed 2."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
